    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "24 Summerstown Grove, Glasheen, Cork.\r\n\r\nA Stunning 4-Bed Family Home in the Heart of Glasheen\r\n\r\nSet in one of Cork's most sought-after addresses, just moments from Cork University Hospital and UCC, this beautifully renovated four-bedroom, three-bathroom home is ready to move straight into.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully extended to the rear, the property now boasts a bright, spacious dining area — perfect for entertaining or everyday family life. Finished to a high standard throughout, this home combines style, comfort, and versatility.\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nA welcoming sitting room leads through to a well-appointed kitchen and separate dining room, ideal for family life and entertaining. Also on this level is bedroom 4, complete with its own ensuite — offering flexible living, perfect for multigenerational households, guests, or a private home office. A separate shower room and a generous utility room complete this floor, adding further practicality to the home's polished finish."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nRoom\tDimensions\r\nHallway\t—\r\nSitting Room\t4.3m x 3.1m\r\nKitchen\t5.2m x 3.6m\r\nDining Room\t4.7m x 3.6m\r\nBedroom 4\t4.5m x 2.4m\r\nEnsuite\t2.3m x 1.5m\r\nShower Room\t2.8m x 1.3m\r\nUtility Room\t3.9m x 2.2m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nRoom\tDimensions\r\nStairs\t—\r\nBedroom 1\t3.5m x 3.5m\r\nBedroom 2\t3.5m x 3.5m\r\nBedroom 3\t3.3m x 2.5m\r\nBathroom\t2.9m x 2.3m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Extended rear with spacious dining area \r\nBedroom 4 on the ground floor with ensuite - ideal for guests or multigenerational living \r\nSecond ground-floor shower room and utility room \r\nDriveway and rear patio \r\nGreen area frontage \r\nWalking distance to CUH and UCC \r\nTurnkey condition throughout"
